# The core-loss STEM-EELS simulation paper. Cite this one for work using
# PrismEelsSimulator, prism_eels_image or the elastic PRISM operators rather
# than the reconstruction pipeline. Metadata from Crossref (2026-11-05); the
# journal has not yet assigned a volume or article number.
references:
  - type: article
    title: "The bi-partitioned PRISM (BiP-PRISM) algorithm for fast and scalable core-loss STEM-EELS simulations"
    journal: "Journal of Physics: Materials"
    year: 2026
    doi: 10.1088/2515-7639/aebdd0
    authors:
      - family-names: Pelz
        given-names: Philipp
        email: philipp.pelz@fau.de
        orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8009-4515"
